          "quote": "z21 Ventures backs AI-as-a-service and deep tech companies targeting North America / Global markets — founded predominantly by world-class Indian-origin entrepreneurs, whether based in India or across the global diaspora. We focus here because this founder profile consistently produces deeply technical, capital-efficient teams building for large, underserved enterprise markets. What sets z21 apart is a community of 205+ operators and executives personally invested in the fund. They generate proprietary deal flow, validate investment decisions with real domain expertise, and remain active partners in every portfolio company through every stage of growth.",
